In the middle of your map is an unaligned temple with priest,
surrounded by an unlit morgue, filled with zombies, wraiths, vampires and
demons (substitute every M by a Z, W, L, or V). The area surrounding
the morgue is lit.

Now wake some of them up by moving off and back on your staircase (at
the right). Wait until you're practically surrounded and move down
(back to where you came from: the quest goes up). You will be followed
by at most eight monsters. Since you have Exc/Sto, you don't have to
fear the wraiths and vampires: no level drain! Now hack off all
monsters that followed you. Now EAT ALL WRAITHS. Go back up the
staircase, wait one turn to get surrounded again, and back down you go
again. Repeat until you realize that it is unnaturally quiet.       :-)
This huge morgue usually means PRESTO level 30 for me...

Now, why do you need an uncursed unicorn horn? Simple: a lot of the
zombies are giant zombies. EAT THEM as well to increase your strength.
Then (a)pply the unicorn horn, since you'll have to cure your resulting
sickness (all zombie corpses are rotten). Now, with a bit of luck,
you'll not only be level 30, but you'll also have strength 18/**!

In my opinion, this special quest level more than compensates for the
relatively weak Quest artifact you'll get (the Mitre of Holiness isn't
that good...).

